    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, quick question. im dealing with a really bad sinus infection and my head feels like it's gonna explode. i was gonna grab some Sudafed at the drugstore to help with the congestion, but i'm supposed to be on lisinopril for my high blood pressure. is it okay to take a normal dose of the Sudafed for a few days or will that mess with my meds?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
