      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Taking Sudafed immediately after starting lisinopril or while actively using it can be risky because decongestants may raise your blood pressure. Since you are already on blood pressure medication, you should consult your healthcare provider or pharmacist before taking Sudafed to avoid dangerous pressure spikes. If you must proceed without immediate medical advice, take only the lowest effective dose for the shortest time possible while monitoring your symptoms.",
