      "content": "i get that but saline sprays dont do jack for this kind of stuff. i just need something that actually works so i can sleep. if i just take like one single 60mg dose of the pseudoephedrine, is that really gonna do anything to my blood pressure? i feel like it's probably overkill to worry about one dose when my lisinopril is already working. can i just take one and be done with it?",
